    "body": "The usage could be something like:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<script type=module async blocking=render>\r\nif (someCondition) {\r\n  const { foo } = await import('something.js', {blocking: 'render'});\r\n  // do something with foo\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
