    "body": "Oh, I see. There is no notion of critical subresource for script elements. We just unblock rendering for them after they run. We don't wait for any fetches they initiate, including those by mechanisms such as `fetch()` or `import()` or `new Image()`.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
