    "created_at": "2022-06-02T14:05:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-02T14:05:32Z",
    "body": "> The current HTML spec allowing adding new render-blocking requests only if `document.body` hasn't been inserted.\r\n\r\nI think that should be changed so that new render-blocking requests can be added if there are currently unresolved render-blocking requests, regardless of whether `document.body` exists.",
